-    *   Formula: $a_1 = f_a(\mu)$, $b_1 = f_b(\mu)$ [S2].
-    *   Derived intermediate values: $a_2 = a_1 + (b_1 - a_1) / 2$ and $b_2 = b_1 + (b_1 - a_1) / 2$ [S2].
