-    *   If $v < a_1$: $\alpha = 0$ (transparent) [S2].
-    *   If $v > b_1$: $\alpha = 1$ (opaque) [S2].
-    *   If $a_1 \le v \le b_1$: Linear interpolation of opacity and color between the endpoints defined by $a_1$ and $b_1$ [S2].
