+   - If $v < a_1$: Opacity $\alpha = 0$ (transparent).
+   - If $v > b_1$: Opacity $\alpha = 1$ (opaque).
+   - If $a_1 \le v \le b_1$: Opacity and color are defined by a linear relationship between the intensity and the optical properties [S2].
 
